# qmldir — explicit module manifest for quickshell/modules/filepicker/
# (quick task 260826-pk2). Mirrors every sibling manifest's standing
# instruction: checking this file in disables Quickshell's directory-scanner
# synthesis for this directory, so any .qml type added here that is NOT
# declared below becomes unresolvable with NO load error. A type MUST be
# registered in the SAME commit that creates it.
#
# FilePicker is the only type a consumer should instantiate; the Fp* parts
# are its internals and are declared so the FloatingWindow can resolve them,
# not because anything outside this directory should use them.
module qs.modules.filepicker
FilePicker 1.0 FilePicker.qml
FpSidebar 1.0 FpSidebar.qml
FpHeaderBar 1.0 FpHeaderBar.qml
FpFolderContents 1.0 FpFolderContents.qml
FpFooter 1.0 FpFooter.qml
